### `333 serve --tor`: an onion address, for a node that is hiding.

serve-onion-launching = 正在啟動 onion 服務

serve-onion-raising = 隱藏地址。這可能要幾分鐘。
    .keyword = 開啟中

serve-onion-not-reachable = { $seconds } 秒後仍無法到達

serve-onion-waiting = 正在等待服務可到達

serve-onion-unseen = { $address }
    .keyword = 隱藏

serve-onion-invite = { $invitation }
    .keyword = 邀請

serve-onion-accepting = 正在接受對方

serve-onion-not-built = 本客戶端編譯時沒有 Tor，無法釋出 onion 地址
